            "SEO timelines depend on the starting point. Critical technical fixes may produce measurable changes sooner, while broader gains from content, authority, internal linking, local SEO, and competitive commercial queries usually require sustained execution. The specialist should define leading indicators and realistic milestones rather than guarantee rankings.",
        ],
    },
    {
        question:
            "How are SEO candidates evaluated?",
        answers: [
            "Candidates undergo experience screening, technical and practical SEO scenarios, search-intent and content analysis, analytics interpretation, tool validation, English assessment, work-sample review when available, and interviews focused on realistic website and business situations.",
